 More M&amp;A 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 🚀 Airbus (Paris: AIR) is weighing a sale of its U.S. space business, per the FT. axios.link/45ZmA3j 

 • Fomo , a VC-backed social trading app, acquired Mobula 's data-indexing software and team for $17m, per Axios Pro . axios.link/4xufZtH 

 • House Foods Group (Tokyo: 2810) is weighing a sale of curry restaurant chain CoCo Ichibanya , per Nikkei. axios.link/3SDL9zK 

 • Nvidia (Nasdaq: NVDA) is investing $3.5b into Taiwanese chipmaker MediaTek (TAI: 2454). axios.link/4gFd2zb 

 ⚡ Ranger Energy Services (NYSE: RNGR) agreed to acquire the U.S. coiled-tubing assets of STEP Energy Services . axios.link/4yauMJZ 

 
 
